==Battleground==
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Osamu Mikumo & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] can help  with stalling the angels. Be aware of Osamu’s waves, as they can reach up to the backline, [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], however, can alleviate this issue.

Stack [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]]s and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]]s while spawning [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho Cat]]s and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]]s to protect them, [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] can help if you have her.

